WEBVTT

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:02.456
so as much love as we teach them,
they will give it back to us.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:03.856
Blessings. Thank you.

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:07.880
(Applause)

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:14.096
AK: So I was born in Kenya,
I was educated in England,

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.856
and my brother here is a Baptist.

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:18.840
I practice as a Sufi Muslim.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:20.736
He's African American,

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:23.656
but I always tell him,
I'm the African American in the group.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.376
I was born in Africa. You were not.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:27.696
(Laughter)

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:29.896
And I naturalized as a citizen.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.896
I'm a first-generation citizen.